              "kind": "field",
              "name": "shadowRootOptions",
              "type": {
                "text": "ShadowRootInit"
              },
              "static": true,
              "default": "{ ...LoomiElement.shadowRootOptions, delegatesFocus: true, }",
              "description": "`delegatesFocus` so the host participates in focus like a native control — clicking\nthe padding focuses the primary half, and `:focus-within`-style styling works. The\nexplicit `focus()` below is still needed: delegation only finds focusable *shadow*\ndescendants, and a `<loomi-button>` host isn't one."
            },
